213: /// The main, post-onboarding application: 5 primary destinations
214: /// (Home, Chat, Tasks, Connections & Providers, Settings) behind one
215: /// persistent navigation shell, plus the Compact overlay (Â§4.4) â€” a
216: /// presentation switch over the same shell, never a separate route.
