 14: /// -> digest-bound approval card (task, provider, model, effect scope,
 15: /// qualification, digests) -> `execution_begin` -> lifecycle card polled from
 16: /// the worker (queued / approving / starting / running / terminal) with a real
 17: /// mid-run Cancel -> receipt. On open the screen lists every execution the
 18: /// worker knows about (reconnect): nothing shown here is UI memory, every
 19: /// state is re-read from the worker, which re-reads the ledger, the journal
 20: /// and the server. Nothing is simulated when no installation has opted in.
